<metadata><name>Snowlands 1063 Shot Rock Loop</name><desc>lollipop (stem back from waypoint 3). 5.8 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1063_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
